{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 38","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is taken on the extension of side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> of parallelogram <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65e4f2d5cc59e5ffbed3734130e8c45b643adc91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> intersects diagonal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/e/27e525b776c49bbe7d0ae66cfc7ab8f58f40624e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/c/0ac49d4352e6aa10273e790490ef2c7b2854d1d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EF = 32$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6afc078e8f51822c5384e9e1c7be865bfd7209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$GF = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/b/a7baf95ecafc2d7791788ec79aeeae390d60b119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e590a9c42f342bc734ce01d13da22e79e9514f57.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(7cm); pair A = (0, 0), B = (7, 0), C = (10, 5), D = (3, 5), F = (5.7, 9.5); pair G = intersectionpoints(B--F, D--C)[0]; pair E = intersectionpoints(A--C, B--F)[0]; draw(A--D--C--B--cycle); draw(A--C); draw(D--F--B); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, NW); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, N); label(&quot;$G$&quot;, G, NE); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, SE); //Credit to MSTang for the asymptote[/asy]\" width=\"332\" height=\"318\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/2/8028e73f23d5d53429a03c118bd8033f84dd21c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 8\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"376\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/836fc8df474c105a5af0235bd19569b3e910150c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BE = x$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/e/feefe6c9dff7ef6104da1badc65f01928652839d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48e46b9fd9aa9c6baecb2d0c97468dcc061485ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF \\parallel BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"19\" />, by AA Similarity, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/101da1bebafd645f6f74a4d697b10075a38aeae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AFE \\sim \\triangle CBE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />.  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/5/695d54c3878bddfb73ed58c0b4076ca43198f9ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AF}{CB} = \\frac{FE}{BE}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />.  Substituting in values results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/d/67df43eb7b50ef7b44ef3b670078a75d77e9aec8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{AF}{y} = \\frac{32}{x}\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"41\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/3789f054399fdf114a5106d4b9b92227bb10a535.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AF = \\frac{32y}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"82\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/7/e274116c3c6cf37c036b0891e3ac7e26da2a13c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$FD = \\frac{32y - xy}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"126\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nIn addition, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/5/0450dbdcb91e19ec8a2fa2e24cf15d2597675080.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DC \\parallel AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"19\" />, so by AA Similarity, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/beb2fe509e75908e12b78b0240d6898ec40462d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle FDG = \\triangle FAB$\" width=\"142\" height=\"13\" />.  That means \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48731c3e7ef6e073013a33f686c3109ce345a9b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\frac{32y-xy}{x}}{\\frac{32y}{x}} = \\frac{24}{x+32}\\]\" width=\"129\" height=\"48\" />\nCross multiply to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f112d2af74add668eace56dc381b4d37809b8122.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{y(32-x)}{x} (x+32) = \\frac{32y}{x} \\cdot 24\\]\" width=\"228\" height=\"38\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cfe818b88e225c12025cbb701eb2e8cabb5517c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/4/bb4e1dc0e17ecc86710a3b136060fc775fb4fc51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae672281d3c18fd8b38d5c0672bf1ee8d880a8d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(32-x)(32+x) = 32 \\cdot 24\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/2/85274fd8ad6b9b5a03e758539b4538fba2b1325c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[32^2 - x^2 = 768\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c33f7963cf0ccd048607157d59c21d3e59c43f6c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1024 - 768 = x^2\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e9097fc859c2e0c8f45eb03aaf8d7bccdda6a3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[256 = x^2\\]\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/9/4897c99a855c5b5ec2d3c5a8c1385cb8384c7b5b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[16,-16 = x^2\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"19\" />\nAs the length of lines can never be negative, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2cae13a8f6458d5d8c61ba965d0abb4b08da072.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</